rivacy_specialist.pdf\npublished: unknown\n</document_metadata>\n\nPriya Ramanathan\nData Privacy & Security Specialist — Public Sector & Healthcare\nProfile\nData privacy and security specialist with 7 years of experience conducting compliance assessments and\nleading data protection workstreams for healthcare and government IT projects. Experienced with health\ndata protection regulations, third-party security audits, and Data Processing Agreements.\nRelevant Experience\nData Privacy Lead — Regional Health Records Digitization Program (2022–2023)\nl\nLed the data protection impact assessment for a case management system handling sensitive patient\nrecords across 15 facilities.\nl\nCoordinated a third-party security audit prior to go-live and drafted the resulting remediation plan.\nl\nAuthored the data retention and deletion policy adopted by the client's IT governance board.\nSecurity Compliance Consultant — Public Sector Case Management Rollouts (2019–2022)\nl\nAdvised on role-based access control design and audit logging requirements across three separate\ngovernment case-tracking projects.\nCertifications\nl\nCIPP/E (Certified Information Privacy Professional/Europe)\nl\nCISSP"}}]]